  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GOAT-SAT: Earth observation for weather-smart worm control</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research translation grant to develop a forecasting tool that combines data on rainfall with models of parasite biology and alerts farmers in Botswana when risk to livestock is particularly high. Pre-warning farmers and providing advice on how to respond will mitigate productivity losses from parasite infections. SDGs 2, 1.</narrative>
  </description>
